  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "模板加载（sdk/prompt_loader.py:117-127）",
      "items": [
        "Jinja2 Environment(FileSystemLoader(packs_root), StrictUndefined)",
        "tojson 过滤器 ensure_ascii=False，中文不转义",
        "目录约定：<pack>/prompts/*.j2 与 _sections/ 子目录"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "四级装配优先级（assemble:171-220）",
      "items": [
        "0. override 短路：完全替换，纯文本不走 Jinja2",
        "1. 静态 sections 依次渲染 → 2. 主模板（dynamic 变量）",
        "3. append 挂尾：纯文本追加；空段过滤，\\n\\n 分隔"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "缓存与注入",
      "items": [
        "section 级缓存：仅「无变量 + cacheable」缓存，有变量必重算",
        "frontmatter 解析缓存；clear_cache 支持热更新",
        "注入链：lifespan → build_graph → nodes.configure → ToolContext",
        "工具侧无 prompt_loader 返回空串 + warning（降级不阻断）"
      ]
    }
  ]
